<p>(A) - Includes a gain in the fourth quarter and year of $5,120,000, $.11 a share, from settlement of Canadian tax matters, and a net loss of $675,000, $.01 a share, from modifications to foreign oil and gas contracts, and a gain in the year of $17,679,000, $.39 a share, from the sale of onshore producing oil and gas properties in the United States.</p>
<p>(B) - Restated to conform to 1996 presentation. (C) - Includes net losses for the fourth quarter and year of $168,367,000, $3.75 a share, for impairment of long-lived assets and $4,285,000, $.10 a share, related to reduction-in-force programs; gains of $5,529,000, $.12 a share, for the fourth quarter and $13,603,000, $.30 a share, for the year from settlement of tax matters; and a net gain for the year of $6,983,000, $.16 a share, from adjustment of estimates for self-insured liabilities.</p>
<p>(D) - Includes estimated costs of $2,100,000, $.05 a share, for spin-off of the Company's farm, timber, and real estate segment.</p>
